    "des": ["DES 分组密码，支持 ECB/CBC/CFB/OFB/CTR。","DES 分組密碼，支援 ECB/CBC/CFB/OFB/CTR。","DES block cipher, supporting ECB/CBC/CFB/OFB/CTR.","DES ブロック暗号。ECB/CBC/CFB/OFB/CTR に対応。","DES 블록 암호, ECB/CBC/CFB/OFB/CTR 지원.","Chiffrement par blocs DES, modes ECB/CBC/CFB/OFB/CTR.","DES-Blockchiffre mit den Modi ECB/CBC/CFB/OFB/CTR.","Блочный шифр DES, режимы ECB/CBC/CFB/OFB/CTR."],
